  "title": "The Traffic Light Revolution",
  "type": "assessment",
  "summary": "Homework 1 for Session 1 (Your Vision, Your Team), rebuilt from the 2025 Four Quadrants Service Assessment. Five tabs: (1) select services from a 51-item library across Operator, Steward, Catalyst and Strategist, add custom services, and mark each GREEN, YELLOW or RED; (2) assess each service's share of the working week, with hours computed from the user's weekly hours, plus action (keep, grow, outsource, automate, delegate, eliminate) and priority; (3) analytics of time by quadrant and by light; (4) insights and the annual value of RED hours redeployed to advisory at a user-set rate (48 working weeks); (5) a 30-day and 90-day action plan. Opens on a sample practice. Passes rated services, RED share and hours to Homework 2 and Homework 4 through browser storage.",
  "interactive": true,
  "homework": true,
  "source": "Four Quadrants Assessment Tool - Fixed.html (2025)",
  "sharedStorageKeys": [
    "bn-traffic-light"
  ],
  "brand": {
    "indigo": "#667EEA",
    "purple": "#764BA2",
    "deep": "#44337A",
